<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10832" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνυδρ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>waterless,</i> of arid countries, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.185
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάπεδα</span> Trag. ap. Phot.<i><span class="en">
				p.151
			</span></i> R.; esp. <i>without spring-water,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.7
			</span></i> codd., cf. <i><span class="en">
				149
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἄνυδρος</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.4
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				103
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Is.</u>
				44.3
			</span></i>; of seasons, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέρος</span>
				Id.<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>; in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1085
			</span></i> (lyr.), of a corpse, <i>deprived of funeral lustrations;
				unwatered,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμύρνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ion</u>
					89
				</span></i>
			 (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνυδρον, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρύχνον μανικόν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.73
			</span></i>.</div>
